"value":5,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3477210","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3376860-1845383656394265","game_id":"steam-3376860","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v1.0.2: Demo bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Hi everyone!It's been a month since the new demo went live. Thank you all for playing and sharing your feedback!All reported bugs have now been fixed. If you run into anything else, or something seems off and you're not sure whether it counts as a bug, feel free to reach out anytime.What's changed:Updated story locks in Act 1Fixed typos in both the Chinese and English textUpdated the original background art for the Blackout Building and the LabMade routes easier to unlock, so you're less likely ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T17:52:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394265","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3376860-1843481262699562","game_id":"steam-3376860","kind":"announcement","title":"TROT Deluxe Version launches on November 26th, 2026 ✨","summary":"We’re excited to announce that the release of The Retrospection Of Tomorrow - the beloved, heart-wrenching time-travel visual novel - is only 2 months away!We’re incredibly proud of what we’ve created and cannot wait to welcome you on this exciting journey. Meet handsome guys, make them fall in love with you, and save them from certain death!Release Date: November 26th at 7:00 PMPrice: $14.99 USD (Enjoy a 20% discount for the first two weeks of launch!)Wishlist the game on Steam and play the fre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T13:58:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699562","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3376860-1842846814446487","game_id":"steam-3376860","kind":"announcement","title":"✨ The Brand-New Demo for The Retrospection Of Tomorrow is Live!","summary":"Before the game's official release, we will be participating in our final Steam Next Fest. Ahead of that, we are absolutely thrilled to bring you the brand-new Steam Demo for the game!As a genre-bending, long-form visual novel, TROT is weaving together sci-fi mystery, psychological thriller, and intense romance.You will step into a non-linear labyrinth as Fay (name customizeable), drifting between reality and delusion. While forging deep bonds with four distinct Love Interests... you are forced ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T13:18:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3376860-1796631172320829","game_id":"steam-3376860","kind":"announcement","title":"The Retrospection Of Tomorrow – Kickstarter Now Live!","summary":"Hi everyone! Our Kickstarter is finally live~ 🎉 It has been a week and we reached 60% already! Our goal is to raise $12,000 CAD in 31 days (4-3~5-3) to cover finished localization, a basic OST, logo design, PV commission, and various art commissions—plus prep funds for Act 3’s development. With your support, we can unlock stretch goals like voice acting and additional content! If you love the game, definitely check it out and help bring the Deluxe Version to life! 💫","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-12T20:40:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1796631172320829","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3376860-1794102528117421","game_id":"steam-3376860","kind":"announcement","title":"The Retrospection Of Tomorrow Demo Launch! (PC, Mac, Steamdeck)","summary":"For those who have played, you already know this story unfolds in a nonlinear way, offering a unique visual novel experience✨ This demo includes TROT's Act 1 content, with an estimated playtime of 3-5 hours. You’ll meet the 4 romanceable characters in this demo: a childhood friend, a transfer student, a college classmate… and even a professor(?) This is just the beginning of a time-travel adventure spanning decades—hope you enjoy the ride!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-14T19:28:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528117421","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3376860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3376860":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3376860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z"},"3477210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:12Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3376860","app_id":3376860,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"777b5cc12797ec2f657b651b617d7cf90ba34602f2c2276745d609078cca691b"